<title>JAPAN: BOJ drains 100 bln yen from money market--traders.</title>
<headline>BOJ drains 100 bln yen from money market--traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan (BOJ) drained a net 100 billion yen from the money market on Tuesday, money traders said.</p>
</text>
